{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the fiercest rugby showdown on the planet!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your side from the world's best and battle through a\u00a0gruelling season to become the world number one in this fast-paced, arcade-style clash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With\u00a0packed stadiums,\u00a0lightning-fast plays, and\u00a0bone-rattling hits, every match is a high-stakes dash to glory. Whether you're smashing through tackles or diving for the try line, this is rugby played at its most ferocious.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a side. Play for pride.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Your Favourite Team</strong> \u2013 Compete as men's or women's <strong>rugby\u00a0</strong>national teams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer</strong> - Play against your friends in local multiplayer.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive controls</strong>\u2013 Deliver that perfect pass, bone-crunching tackle, slick side-step, or the big \u201cdon\u2019t argue\u201d hand-off on your way to scoring a worldie of a try.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb to the top of MINI Rugby\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Battle through a full<strong>\u00a0</strong>season and win tournaments to earn the right to challenge the legendary <strong>World VII</strong> squad.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train and Improve</strong> \u2013 To be the best rugby team you need to train like the best. Hone your skills and deepen your understanding of <strong>rugby\u00a0</strong>with drills and friendlies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Stamina &amp; Power-Ups</strong> \u2013 Remember it\u2019s the tournaments that make the difference. Make sure your team is rested and prepped for each if your want to at the top of the league at the end of the season. \u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customise your name</strong> - Customise your team by giving your players unique names.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn Rugby Tactics</strong> - learn advanced rugby tactics on the field and rugby management that can be applied to Rugby Sevens, Rugby Union or Rugby League.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your team, take on the world's best and chase MINI Rugby glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download now and take on the challenge!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3842180?t=1769534030","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3842180?t=1769534030","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842180/a770342e9cb4308a49389228e57f4fa09ad725f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769534030","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842180/a770342e9cb4308a49389228e57f4fa09ad725f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769534030","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3864460,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the fiercest rugby showdown on the planet!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your side from the world's best and battle through a\u00a0gruelling season to become the world number one in this fast-paced, arcade-style clash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With\u00a0packed stadiums,\u00a0lightning-fast plays, and\u00a0bone-rattling hits, every match is a high-stakes dash to glory. Whether you're smashing through tackles or diving for the try line, this is rugby played at its most ferocious.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a side. Play for pride.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Your Favourite Team</strong> \u2013 Compete as men's or women's <strong>rugby\u00a0</strong>national teams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer</strong> - Play against your friends in local multiplayer.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive controls</strong>\u2013 Deliver that perfect pass, bone-crunching tackle, slick side-step, or the big \u201cdon\u2019t argue\u201d hand-off on your way to scoring a worldie of a try.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb to the top of MINI Rugby\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Battle through a full<strong>\u00a0</strong>season and win tournaments to earn the right to challenge the legendary <strong>World VII</strong> squad.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train and Improve</strong> \u2013 To be the best rugby team you need to train like the best. Hone your skills and deepen your understanding of <strong>rugby\u00a0</strong>with drills and friendlies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Stamina &amp; Power-Ups</strong> \u2013 Remember it\u2019s the tournaments that make the difference. Make sure your team is rested and prepped for each if your want to at the top of the league at the end of the season. \u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customise your name</strong> - Customise your team by giving your players unique names.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn Rugby Tactics</strong> - learn advanced rugby tactics on the field and rugby management that can be applied to Rugby Sevens, Rugby Union or Rugby League.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your team, take on the world's best and chase MINI Rugby glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download now and take on the challenge!</p>","developers":["Chunky Games"],"genres":[{"description